<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体" lang=EN-US>6</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">月<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>日 高考倒计时<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>天<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 22pt">家长们微信<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>告状<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmlcom1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 22pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmlcom1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT color=#008000 size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'"><FONT size=3>凌晨<SPAN lang=EN-US>5:03,</SPAN>杨老师收到微信<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>透过小小的手机屏幕<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>让人感到深深的焦灼。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">放假天天看电视不复习，是心情不好吗？还是太好了？急！<SPAN lang=EN-US>”“</SPAN>气煞，又不能不说<SPAN lang=EN-US>”……</SPAN>这是来自学生小冬<SPAN lang=EN-US>(</SPAN>化名<SPAN lang=EN-US>)</SPAN>妈妈的留言<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>由于停课复习<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>一些孩子在家里的表现<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>让家长陷入无措的状态<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>虽然很心焦却怕表达不当<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>增加孩子的心理压力。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">小冬终于来学校了。<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>在杨老师的考前日志里<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>记者看到了这样一句话。小冬是一个比较有个性的孩子<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>做事很有主见。杨老师先是表示尊重他留在家里复习的选择<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>同时建议他来校复习<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>并且就小冬的个人情况<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>给出了来校复习的诸多好处<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>其中一条是<SPAN lang=EN-US>:</SPAN>让妈妈安心<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>也可以少听唠叨。小冬最后选择来校复习<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>让杨老师舒了一口气。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">最后几天哪儿复习并不重要<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>关键在于学生自己的感觉和状态<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>家长们请淡定<SPAN lang=EN-US>……”</SPAN>高三班的家长群里<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>杨老师不断地安抚着家长。其实<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>这几天<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>高三班的班主任们就像是消防员<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>一方面给家长灭火<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>一方面给孩子鼓劲儿。<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>孩子的个性差异很大<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>有的表现出来<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>有的隐藏在内心独自承受<SPAN lang=EN-US>……”</SPAN>杨老师敏锐地留意着每一个孩子<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>用不同的方式开导、鼓励不同性格的学生。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'"><FONT size=3>作为年段长<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>带过六个毕业班的杨老师<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>最为担心的是其他高三班班主任的身体状况。她知道<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>这几天<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>班主任都是<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>高压运行<SPAN lang=EN-US>”,</SPAN>压力带来了失眠<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>焦虑带来了肠胃消化系统问题<SPAN lang=EN-US>……</SPAN>但这些状态<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>学生和家长都是不知道的。虽然班主任自己心里都烧成了火海，但仍然是淡然笃定地为家长们宽心，为学生答疑、减压、鼓劲<SPAN lang=EN-US>……<o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">今天有<SPAN lang=EN-US>300</SPAN>位学生来校复习<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>大部分选择在家复习了。<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>杨老师密切关注着学生的动态<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>心里迫切地希望孩子们来校复习。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'"><FONT size=3>杨老师明白，这几天将是最后的陪伴助攻了。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
