<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体" lang=EN-US>6</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">月<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>日 高考倒计时<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>天<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 22pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">复习场地转移了<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'"><FONT size=3>今天是高三年段同学们留在教学楼复习的最后一天了<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>下午<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>教室开始清场布置考场。学校专门安排了实验教室<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>留给愿意来校复习的同学。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'"><FONT size=3>上午<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>一位高三男生找到杨老师<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>请教数学题目，愁眉苦脸地说自己<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>已被这套试题<SPAN lang=EN-US>‘</SPAN>虐成狗<SPAN lang=EN-US>’</SPAN>了<SPAN lang=EN-US>……”</SPAN>从措辞上看<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>还真让人为他捏把汗。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'"><FONT size=3>然而事后<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>杨老师说<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>这男生成绩比较稳定<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>高一、高二基本上是年段前十名<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>对自己要求一直很高。这样的情况<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>常常出现在<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>追求完美<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>的考生身上<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>对于这样的孩子来说<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>大考前<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>可能适当<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>松松弦<SPAN lang=EN-US>”,</SPAN>或许要比<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>发条拧到头<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>更好。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'"><FONT size=3>下午两点半<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>高三学生陆续来校领取准考证<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>校领导和老师们对孩子进行了考前教育和动员。<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>考完一科丢一科<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>调整心态考下一科<SPAN lang=EN-US>”“</SPAN>人易我易绝不大意，人难我难绝不畏难<SPAN lang=EN-US>”“</SPAN>对监考老师要有礼貌<SPAN lang=EN-US>”……</SPAN>班主任进行着最后的强调<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>虽然是<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>说过说<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>的提醒<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>但大家还是听得很认真<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>生怕漏掉什么。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'">操场和教学楼的显眼位置<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>张贴了<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>重点提醒<SPAN lang=EN-US>”“</SPAN>考试规则<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>等通告<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>教室里原本堆满了卷子和资料的课桌<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>已被收拾得光洁明亮<SPAN lang=EN-US>,16</SPAN>个高三教室<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>每间教室<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>张课桌<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>整齐划一。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN class=htmltag1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'"><FONT size=3>往日浓浓的学习气氛<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>被大考前的寂静整肃所取代。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN class=htmltxt1><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Courier New'" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
